%% OAuth authorization code with PKCE.
sequenceDiagram
actor User
participant Browser
participant Client
participant Auth
participant Resource
User->>Browser: Sign in
Browser->>Client: GET login
Client-->>Browser: Redirect with PKCE challenge
Browser->>Auth: Authorization request
activate Auth
Auth-->>User: Consent screen
User->>Auth: Authenticate and approve
Auth-->>Browser: Redirect with code
deactivate Auth
Browser->>Client: Callback code
activate Client
Client->>Auth: Token request code and verifier
Auth-->>Client: Access token
opt [profile required]
Client->>Resource: Userinfo
Resource-->>Client: Claims
end
Client-->>Browser: Session cookie
Browser-->>User: Signed in
deactivate Client
Note over Client,Auth: Back-channel code exchange
